{"id":"udrkb1nob3ltqwaixsl6u2di2","title":"韩国金融服务委员会允许加密交易所暂停充提业务无需确认攻击","originalTitle":"韩国将允许加密交易所在怀疑遭到黑客攻击时暂停充提业务","summary":"韩国金融服务委员会（FSC）宣布允许加密交易所在怀疑遭黑客攻击时暂停充提业务，无需等待攻击确认。交易所需满足全天候监控、提高冷钱包储备、加强保险覆盖等要求，无法持续监控的交易所只能在值守时段处理充提，并需提前通知用户。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1ce5c-7515-73c0-9e20-9f78781a5a03"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T06:05:28.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:07.083Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T06:10:07.083Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布"],"score":86,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}